WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
My name is Shourya Pradhan and I study in Class 12, Brindavan Boarding School.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.640
My major subject is Humanities.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.640
My favourite activity is volleyball in this school.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:14.640
Because volleyball teaches us a lot about teamwork, leadership qualities.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.640
And we can enjoy volleyball a lot.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:24.640
My best memory of Class 4-12 is the school fete, which was held in Class 10.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.640
We had to make our own stalls there.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.560
and also we had to perfect our games.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:36.380
The manner and the manner was perfect as well.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.380
Even my parents could visit.
